<Tunnel title="No Computer — Power Cycle | Save My Gig!" status="Critical_Path · No Laptop" red>
  <div class="review-flag">DRAFT — review pending. Remove this flag after approval.</div>

  <div class="step-label">Step 2 of 3</div>
  <h2 style="margin-bottom:1rem">Restart the player</h2>

  <div class="panel panel-warn">
    <p style="margin:0">⚠️ <strong>Only do this if nobody is playing on this player right now.</strong> If another DJ is on, skip to the next step.</p>
  </div>

  <ul class="checklist">
    <li>Remove your USB first — press <span class="mono">USB STOP</span> and wait for the light to stop blinking.</li>
    <li>Power the player off. Wait 20 seconds.</li>
    <li>Power it back on and let it fully boot.</li>
    <li>Insert the USB again and wait — some drives take 30+ seconds to mount.</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="question">Does the player read the USB now?</p>

  <a href="/saved?path=critical&branch=no_laptop" class="btn btn-go" data-event="outcome_reached" data-outcome="saved" data-path="critical">
    🟢 Yes — it's reading
  </a>
  <a href="/protocol/critical/no-laptop-3" class="btn btn-stop" data-event="step_completed" data-step="no_laptop_2" data-answer="no">
    🔴 No — still dead
  </a>
</Tunnel>
